   carbons x2       → SphereGeometry(0.33) charcoal #3A3A3A
   molecular H x6   → SphereGeometry(0.20) pure white
   C–C rods x2      → CylinderGeometry(0.055) grey  (2nd = pi rod, fades out in b)
   C–H rods x6      → CylinderGeometry(0.055) grey
   Ni–C bonds x2    → dashed Line grey, faint
   arrows (a) x2    → ArrowHelper down onto each H2
   arrows (b) x3    → ArrowHelper down onto adsorbing ethylene
   arrows (c) x2    → TubeGeometry(QuadraticBezierCurve3) + ConeGeometry, black
   arrow  (d)       → TubeGeometry(QuadraticBezierCurve3) + ConeGeometry, black
   all-stages strip → 4 static mini panels (scale 0.45) laid out along screen-x
   labels           → addLabel + thin black Line leaders ('Ni surface' ends on a lattice atom)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

